{
  "body": {
    "content": [
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Bún chả is one of Hanoi's most loved dishes. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "Smoky grilled pork ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "chả ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "cha"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "sit in a bowl of warm tangy broth alongside cold noodles and a plate of fresh herbs. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "This recipe serves 4.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Get the grill very hot before cooking the pork. A charred, slightly crispy outside is what makes this dish special.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "What you need",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
